iffs and Trade, \nreferred to in the 7th recital of the said  \nproclamation, had appeared in the said  \ngeneral agreement on October 30, 1947;  \nand\nWHEREAS the rate of duty for item  \n1110 of schedule XX specified in the copy \nof the said protocol annexed to the said  \nproclamation of June 11, 1948, reads:  \n“350 per lb. and 25% ad val.”;  and\nWHEREAS the rate of duty for the  \nsaid item should read: “330 per lb. and","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_9996.txt","sha256":"32c8c9d5e3f45c27be85b172b34e1d7b7d8a250a3ddd921ba210edd8d7c281a2","source":{"line":517,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"4cceb947e7b36e1bfa2e8cf9c2a49dcbb95ad77be3505c7b0b4e8e4d3d8fb0ff"}}]}
